1789          /*--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1790           * U8_T KVM_Power_Jump_Check(U8_T pid)
1791           * Purpose : This function will check the Power Jump Switch flag, and decide jump 
1792           *       or stay
1793           * Params  : NONE
1794           * Returns : None.
1795           * Note    : None.
